{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1791296656097,"sessionID":"ses_eee6682caffeNR256EljA8JDDs","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"01a11199d1d027903b2c923ff1f8a105","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-kalepail-Desktop-kalepail-skills/fd5aae97-76bc-4bb3-8597-af0fa91bb3f0/scratchpad/probe-runs/glm-max__routing__r1__1791296633/work/policy.md"},"output":"<path>/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-kalepail-Desktop-kalepail-skills/fd5aae97-76bc-4bb3-8597-af0fa91bb3f0/scratchpad/probe-runs/glm-max__routing__r1__1791296633/work/policy.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Routing policy (self-contained: use only this file)\n2: Effort scale, lowest to highest: low < medium < high < max.\n3: | model       | family    | cli | lanes                      | floor  | ceiling |\n4: |-------------|-----------|-----|----------------------------|--------|---------|\n5: | atlas-pro   | Northwind | nw  | implement, review, research | high   | max     |\n6: | atlas-lite  | Northwind | nw  | extract, prose             | low    | high    |\n7: | corvid-9    | Corvid    | cv  | implement, review          | medium | max     |\n8: | corvid-mini | Corvid    | cv  | extract                    | low    | medium  |\n9: | pellet-2    | Pellet    | pl  | prose, research            | medium | high    |\n10: Lane order (first eligible model wins):\n11: - implement: atlas-pro, corvid-9\n12: - review: corvid-9, atlas-pro\n13: - research: atlas-pro, pellet-2\n14: - extract: corvid-mini, atlas-lite\n15: - prose: pellet-2, atlas-lite\n16: R1 A model is eligible only if the lane appears in its lanes column.\n17: R2 Reviewer rule: for a review lane, the model's family must differ from the request's author_family.\n18: R3 Pinned CLI: if a request pins a cli, only models on that cli are eligible.\n19: R4 Unavailable: skip any model the request lists as unavailable.\n20: R5 Unrouted: if no model is eligible, answer model \"Unrouted\" and effort null.\n21: R6 Effort: below the chosen model's floor -> use the floor; above its ceiling -> use the ceiling;\n22:    otherwise keep the requested effort. Effort never makes a model ineligible.\n23: Answer format: answers.json = [{\"id\": \"...\", \"model\": \"...\", \"effort\": \"...\" or null}, ...]\n\n(End of file - total 23 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Routing policy (self-contained: use only this file)\nEffort scale, lowest to highest: low < medium < high < max.\n| model       | family    | cli | lanes                      | floor  | ceiling |\n|-------------|-----------|-----|----------------------------|--------|---------|\n| atlas-pro   | Northwind | nw  | implement, review, research | high   | max     |\n| atlas-lite  | Northwind | nw  | extract, prose             | low    | high    |\n| corvid-9    | Corvid    | cv  | implement, review          | medium | max     |\n| corvid-mini | Corvid    | cv  | extract                    | low    | medium  |\n| pellet-2    | Pellet    | pl  | prose, research            | medium | high    |\nLane order (first eligible model wins):\n- implement: atlas-pro, corvid-9\n- review: corvid-9, atlas-pro\n- research: atlas-pro, pellet-2\n- extract: corvid-mini, atlas-lite\n- prose: pellet-2, atlas-lite\nR1 A model is eligible only if the lane appears in its lanes column.\nR2 Reviewer rule: for a review lane, the model's family must differ from the request's author_family.\nR3 Pinned CLI: if a request pins a cli, only models on that cli are eligible.\nR4 Unavailable: skip any model the request lists as unavailable.\nR5 Unrouted: if no model is eligible, answer model \"Unrouted\" and effort null.","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-kalepail-Desktop-kalepail-skills/fd5aae97-76bc-4bb3-8597-af0fa91bb3f0/scratchpad/probe-runs/glm-max__routing__r1__1791296633/work/policy.md","text":"# Routing policy (self-contained: use only this file)\nEffort scale, lowest to highest: low < medium < high < max.\n| model       | family    | cli | lanes                      | floor  | ceiling |\n|-------------|-----------|-----|----------------------------|--------|---------|\n| atlas-pro   | Northwind | nw  | implement, review, research | high   | max     |\n| atlas-lite  | Northwind | nw  | extract, prose             | low    | high    |\n| corvid-9    | Corvid    | cv  | implement, review          | medium | max     |\n| corvid-mini | Corvid    | cv  | extract                    | low    | medium  |\n| pellet-2    | Pellet    | pl  | prose, research            | medium | high    |\nLane order (first eligible model wins):\n- implement: atlas-pro, corvid-9\n- review: corvid-9, atlas-pro\n- research: atlas-pro, pellet-2\n- extract: corvid-mini, atlas-lite\n- prose: pellet-2, atlas-lite\nR1 A model is eligible only if the lane appears in its lanes column.\nR2 Reviewer rule: for a review lane, the model's family must differ from the request's author_family.\nR3 Pinned CLI: if a request pins a cli, only models on that cli are eligible.\nR4 Unavailable: skip any model the request lists as unavailable.\nR5 Unrouted: if no model is eligible, answer model \"Unrouted\" and effort null.\nR6 Effort: below the chosen model's floor -> use the floor; above its ceiling -> use the ceiling;\n   otherwise keep the requested effort. Effort never makes a model ineligible.\nAnswer format: answers.json = [{\"id\": \"...\", \"model\": \"...\", \"effort\": \"...\" or null}, ...]","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":23,"totalLines":23,"truncated":false}},"title":"private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-kalepail-Desktop-kalepail-skills/fd5aae97-76bc-4bb3-8597-af0fa91bb3f0/scratchpad/probe-runs/glm-max__routing__r1__1791296633/work/policy.md","time":{"start":1791296656090,"end":1791296656096}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"The user wants me to apply a routing policy from policy.md to requests in requests.json. Let me read both files first.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_11199cff7001wpUjN7T8gFXvrE","sessionID":"ses_eee6682caffeNR256EljA8JDDs","messageID":"msg_111997ef3001xWSTMNOkJB2Ep4"}}
