{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1791296674059,"sessionID":"ses_eee6682caffeNR256EljA8JDDs","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call_40a0df8111d54017a52e6584","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"[\n {\"id\": \"q1\", \"model\": \"atlas-pro\", \"effort\": \"high\"},\n {\"id\": \"q2\", \"model\": \"atlas-pro\", \"effort\": \"high\"},\n {\"id\": \"q3\", \"model\": \"Unrouted\", \"effort\": null},\n {\"id\": \"q4\", \"model\": \"atlas-lite\", \"effort\": \"high\"},\n {\"id\": \"q5\", \"model\": \"corvid-mini\", \"effort\": \"medium\"},\n {\"id\": \"q6\", \"model\": \"pellet-2\", \"effort\": \"high\"}\n]\n","filePath":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-kalepail-Desktop-kalepail-skills/fd5aae97-76bc-4bb3-8597-af0fa91bb3f0/scratchpad/probe-runs/glm-max__routing__r1__1791296633/work/answers.json"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-kalepail-Desktop-kalepail-skills/fd5aae97-76bc-4bb3-8597-af0fa91bb3f0/scratchpad/probe-runs/glm-max__routing__r1__1791296633/work/answers.json","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-kalepail-Desktop-kalepail-skills/fd5aae97-76bc-4bb3-8597-af0fa91bb3f0/scratchpad/probe-runs/glm-max__routing__r1__1791296633/work/answers.json","time":{"start":1791296674043,"end":1791296674049}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Let me apply the policy to each request.\n\nModels:\n- atlas-pro: family Northwind, cli nw, lanes implement/review/research, floor high, ceiling max\n- atlas-lite: family Northwind, cli nw, lanes extract/prose, floor low, ceiling high\n- corvid-9: family Corvid, cli cv, lanes implement/review, floor medium, ceiling max\n- corvid-mini: family Corvid, cli cv, lanes extract, floor low, ceiling medium\n- pellet-2: family Pellet, cli pl, lanes prose/research, floor medium, ceiling high\n\nLane orders:\n- implement: atlas-pro, corvid-9\n- review: corvid-9, atlas-pro\n- research: atlas-pro, pellet-2\n- extract: corvid-mini, atlas-lite\n- prose: pellet-2, atlas-lite\n\nR1: model eligible only if lane in its lanes column.\nR2: for review lane, model's family must differ from request's author_family.\nR3: if request pins a cli, only models on that cli are eligible.\nR4: skip models listed as unavailable.\nR5: if no model eligible, model \"Unrouted\", effort null.\nR6: effort clamping to floor/ceiling. Effort never makes a model ineligible.\n\nNow each request:\n\nq1: lane implement, effort medium.\nLane order: atlas-pro, corvid-9.\n- atlas-pro: lanes include implement (R1 ok). No author_family (R2 not applicable, not review). No pinned cli. No unavailable. So atlas-pro is eligible. Choose atlas-pro.\n- Effort: requested medium. atlas-pro floor high, ceiling max. medium < high -> use floor high.\nAnswer: q1: atlas-pro, high.\n\nq2: lane review, effort high, author_family Corvid.\nLane order: corvid-9, atlas-pro.\n- corvid-9: lanes include review (R1 ok). R2: review lane — model's family (Corvid) must differ from author_family (Corvid). Same family, so not eligible. Skip.\n- atlas-pro: lanes include review (R1 ok). R2: family Northwind differs from Corvid — ok. Eligible. Choose atlas-pro.\n- Effort: high. atlas-pro floor high, ceiling max. high is at floor, within [high, max]. Keep high.\nAnswer: q2: atlas-pro, high.\n\nq3: lane extract, effort low, pinned_cli pl.\nLane order: corvid-mini, atlas-lite.\n- corvid-mini: lanes include extract (R1 ok). R3: pinned cli pl — corvid-mini is on cv, not pl. Not eligible.\n- atlas-lite: lanes include extract (R1 ok). R3: atlas-lite is on nw, not pl. Not eligible.\n- No model eligible. R5: model \"Unrouted\", effort null.\nWait — pellet-2 is on pl but its lanes are prose, research — extract is not in its lanes, so R1 fails. And lane order only lists corvid-mini, atlas-lite for extract anyway. The lane order list is the order of consideration; R1 says a model is eligible only if the lane appears in its lanes column. The lane order lists the candidates in order. So only corvid-mini and atlas-lite are considered for extract. Both fail R3 (pinned cli pl). Answer: q3: Unrouted, null.\n\nq4: lane prose, effort max, unavailable: [pellet-2].\nLane order: pellet-2, atlas-lite.\n- pellet-2: lanes include prose (R1 ok). R4: unavailable lists pellet-2 — skip.\n- atlas-lite: lanes include prose (R1 ok). Not unavailable. Eligible. Choose atlas-lite.\n- Effort: max. atlas-lite floor low, ceiling high. max > high -> use ceiling high.\nAnswer: q4: atlas-lite, high.\n\nq5: lane extract, effort max.\nLane order: corvid-mini, atlas-lite.\n- corvid-mini: lanes include extract (R1 ok). Eligible. Choose corvid-mini.\n- Effort: max. corvid-mini floor low, ceiling medium. max > medium -> use ceiling medium.\nAnswer: q5: corvid-mini, medium.\n\nq6: lane research, effort high, pinned_cli pl.\nLane order: atlas-pro, pellet-2.\n- atlas-pro: lanes include research (R1 ok). R3: pinned cli pl — atlas-pro on nw. Not eligible.\n- pellet-2: lanes include research (R1 ok). R3: pellet-2 on pl — ok. Eligible. Choose pellet-2.\n- Effort: high. pellet-2 floor medium, ceiling high. high is at ceiling, within [medium, high]. Keep high.\nAnswer: q6: pellet-2, high.\n\nFinal answers:\n[\n  {\"id\": \"q1\", \"model\": \"atlas-pro\", \"effort\": \"high\"},\n  {\"id\": \"q2\", \"model\": \"atlas-pro\", \"effort\": \"high\"},\n  {\"id\": \"q3\", \"model\": \"Unrouted\", \"effort\": null},\n  {\"id\": \"q4\", \"model\": \"atlas-lite\", \"effort\": \"high\"},\n  {\"id\": \"q5\", \"model\": \"corvid-mini\", \"effort\": \"medium\"},\n  {\"id\": \"q6\", \"model\": \"pellet-2\", \"effort\": \"high\"}\n]\n\nWrite answers.json in the work directory.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_1119a1252001efn3GzQ1eq80bF","sessionID":"ses_eee6682caffeNR256EljA8JDDs","messageID":"msg_11199d638001PI27pvoh6nCDwO"}}
